<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Bank Bumiputra H1 after-tax down 24.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Bank Bumiputra H1 after-tax down 24.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	 142.74   vs	 190.16</p>
<p>    Interest income	1,446.0    vs     1,085.0</p>
<p>    Non-interest income    127.23   vs	 102.70</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   255.63   vs	 208.34</p>
<p>    Net income	     1,247.0    vs     1,082.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's second largest banking group, Bank Bumiputra Malaysia Bhd, is owned by Ministry of Finance Inc. It is slated for privatisation and public listing in the near future.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
